> The retained original experiment

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/recursive_descent_original.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
