> API and interpretation

Number conversion uses locale-independent from_chars over exactly the scanned
decimal token. Nonfinite conversion/arithmetic and division by zero reject; no
NaN/Infinity is reported as an evaluated scalar. Embedded NUL never masquerades
as end of the borrowed source. The produced tree owns its source and node
values. Native measured tree layout validates source spans and tree shape,
rather than reconstructing a guessed parse from text. A node child equal to
SIZE_MAX means absent; that explicit sentinel is printed as an integer in the
tiny table. The default 512 live-call bound protects ordinary nesting; callers
may configure it explicitly.

Reusable producers, fixtures and histories live in the canonical C++ library.
Captured records own their values and do not come from a separate report replay.
Selected counters and record/scalar policies are specified at their API
boundaries; they are not peak-byte or wall-time budgets. Synthetic structural
inputs are controlled fixtures for these mechanisms.

